Z||000000||grgoyl86||08-20-2001||06:13 PM||||Hi Folks,<P>Here, finally, is the list of winners from Saturday's Fiero Dutch Classic.<P>Congrats to all the winners.<P><FONT SIZE="3"><B>SN </B> (Stock Notchback) </FONT><BR>  <FONT COLOR="blue">1</FONT>    Jim Gilbert    Oley, PA    Black 85 Fiero GT<BR>  <FONT COLOR="blue">2</FONT>	Frank Sombers	Ephrata, PA	White 88 Fiero<BR>  <FONT COLOR="blue">2</FONT>	Rocco Biscieglia	Middletown, DE	Red 88 Fiero Formula<BR>  <FONT COLOR="blue">3</FONT>	Bruce Homeyard	Gilbertsville, PA	Silver 85 Fiero GT<BR>  <FONT COLOR="blue">3</FONT>	Matt Dorniak	East Meadow, NY	White 84 Fiero Pace Car<P><FONT SIZE="3"><B>SF </B> (Stock Fastback)</FONT><BR>  <FONT COLOR="blue">1</FONT>	Tom Derr	Mechanicsburg, PA	Red 88 Fiero GT<BR>  <FONT COLOR="blue">2</FONT>	Veronica Houck	Akron, PA	White 88 Fiero GT<BR>  <FONT COLOR="blue">2</FONT>	Jeff DeDay	Selinsgrove, PA	Maroon 87 Fiero GT<BR>  <FONT COLOR="blue">3</FONT>	Joe Rebilas	Collegeville, PA	White 86 Fiero GT<BR>  <FONT COLOR="blue">3</FONT>	Paul Perkins	Spring City, PA	Black 88 Fiero GT<P><FONT SIZE="3"><B>HN </B> (High Mileage Notchback)</FONT><BR>  <FONT COLOR="blue">1</FONT>	John Lagler	Zionsville, PA	Gold 86 Fiero SE<P><FONT SIZE="3"><B>HF </B> (High Mileage Fastback)</FONT><BR>  <FONT COLOR="blue">1</FONT>	Mark Johnson	Harrisburg, PA	Maroon 87 Fiero GT<BR>  <FONT COLOR="blue">2</FONT>	John Brown	South Charleston, WV	Blue 87 Fiero GT<BR>  <FONT COLOR="blue">3</FONT>	Richard Gage	Lakehurst, NJ	Dark Grey Met. 85 Fiero GT<P><B>CN </B> (Custom Notchback)[/SIZE]<BR>  <FONT COLOR="blue">1</FONT>	Denny Lambert	Leola, PA	Silver 86 Fiero SE<BR>  <FONT COLOR="blue">2</FONT>	Jason Haughey	Reading, PA	White 85 Fiero SE<BR>  <FONT COLOR="blue">3</FONT>	Joshua Bumpus	New Bedford, MA	Red 88 Fiero<P><FONT SIZE="3"><B>CF </B> (Custom Fastback)</FONT><BR>  <FONT COLOR="blue">1</FONT>	David Horst	Akron, PA	Red 88 Fiero GT<BR>  <FONT COLOR="blue">2</FONT>	Bob Schlag	Dover, PA	Red 86 Fiero GT<BR>  <FONT COLOR="blue">3</FONT>	Cory Watts	Dillsburg, PA	Yellow 86 Fiero GT<P><FONT SIZE="3"><B>MN </B> (Modified Notchback)</FONT><BR>  <FONT COLOR="blue">1</FONT>	Keith Gerhard	MAFB, NJ	Yellow/White 84 Fiero (IMSA, V8)<P><FONT SIZE="3"><B>MF </B> (Modified Fastback)</FONT><BR>  <FONT COLOR="blue">1</FONT>	Fran Passuite	Lockport, NY	White 84 Fiero Pace Car (Fastback, Turbo)<BR>  <FONT COLOR="blue">2</FONT>	Lawrence Wheeler	Spencerport, NY	White 88 Fiero GT (3.4)<BR>  <FONT COLOR="blue">3</FONT>	Joe Burke	Manheim, PA	Green 88 Fiero GT (IMSA)<P>-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-<P>I don't have the winners of the rally. Someone please help with that?<P>More details will be forthcoming.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by grgoyl86 (edited 08-21-2001).]||||reg||14
