Z||000006||Hank is Here||08-21-2001||05:28 PM||||Skitime, <BR>been back here for a full five days.  Your car is really hard to forget, heck I was parked behind you at the Dutch Classic this past weekend.<P>Jenn, <BR>I was up here part of Sunday but not in the Fiero :( I had a GMC van to move in.  I returned here late Monday night with the Fiero though.  I may come on Saturday, I need to go to home to Harrisburg on Sunday, so...  If I do come I'll have the best (or most appropriate) gift for you even though I don't know you.  hehehe....any guesses (this is if I come)<P>Hank<BR>(aka Mark Johnson)||||reg||1
Z||000007||Fierochic88||08-21-2001||06:31 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Hank is Here:<P>Jenn, <BR>I was up here part of Sunday but not in the Fiero  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> I had a GMC van to move in.  I returned here late Monday night with the Fiero though.  I may come on Saturday, I need to go to home to Harrisburg on Sunday, so...  If I do come I'll have the best (or most appropriate) gift for you even though I don't know you.  hehehe....any guesses (this is if I come)<P>Hank<BR>(aka Mark Johnson)[/B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Uh Oh...surprises surprises :-)  Anyways, it would be cool if you could come!  Joe (FieroGT914) from PSU will also be here of course...I am only about 1 hour from H-burg so it would kinda not be too far from home!<P>Jennifer<P>||||reg||1
